          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c1_today_fast_single_forward_pass_uncer",
          "text": "Today's fast, single-forward-pass uncertainty methods usually depend on special architectural tricks, like spectral normalization, to stop the network's features from collapsing.",
