          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_those_constraints_quietly_damage_cal",
          "text": "Those constraints can quietly damage calibration and are awkward to bolt onto large pre-trained models.",
