          "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_they_compress_entire_set_small",
          "text": "They compress the entire training set into a small codebook of prototype distributions, and measure how far a new input is from that codebook.",
          "expected_role": "method",
