          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_gives_distance_aware_bottleneck_dab",
          "text": "This gives the Distance Aware Bottleneck, or DAB: a single deterministic model that produces uncertainty in one forward pass.",
