          "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_along_way_they_contribute_practical",
          "text": "Along the way they contribute a practical alternating-minimization training algorithm, a meta-probabilistic distortion that operates over distributions of embeddings, and a post-hoc variant that adds distance awareness to large pre-trained feature extractors.",
