          "chunk_id": "s10_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s10_c2_because_notion_distance_statistical",
          "text": "Because the notion of distance is statistical rather than geometric, DAB offers a unified, Gaussian-Process-like view of uncertainty that works for both classification and regression, and can even be attached after the fact to large pre-trained models.",
